+Version 1.0
+-----------
+
+Released 2018-04-26
+
+-   Python 2.6 and 3.3 are no longer supported.
+-   Bump minimum dependency versions to the latest stable versions:
+    Werkzeug >= 0.14, Jinja >= 2.10, itsdangerous >= 0.24, Click >= 5.1.
